# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to tighten bounds with a speed limit for the latest version of Shaded lightcones"
msgstr "Paano higpitan ang mga bound gamit ang speed limit para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Shaded lightcones"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to tighten bounds with a speed limit"
msgstr "Paano higpitan ang mga bound gamit ang speed limit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/speed-limit-tightening.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Information in a circuit of two-qubit gates cannot spread arbitrarily fast. An error occurring\n"
"several layers before the end, on a qubit far from the observable's support, has no path to reach\n"
"it. `tighten_with_speed_limit` turns that geometric argument (the same intuition behind the\n"
"Lieb-Robinson bounds) into tighter forward bounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi basta-basta mabilis na kumakalat ang impormasyon sa isang circuit ng two-qubit gate. Ang error na nangyari\n"
"ilang layer bago ang dulo, sa qubit na malayo sa support ng observable, ay walang daan para marating\n"
"ito. Ginagawa ng `tighten_with_speed_limit` na mas mahigpit na forward bound ang geometric na argumentong iyon (ang parehong intuwisyon sa likod ng\n"
"mga Lieb-Robinson bound).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The step is cheap, needs nothing beyond what the forward bounds already required, and can only make\n"
"bounds tighter. There is no accuracy trade-off to weigh.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mura ang hakbang na ito, walang kailangang higit sa kinailangan na ng mga forward bound, at maaari lang nitong gawing mas mahigpit ang\n"
"mga bound. Walang trade-off sa katumpakan na dapat timbangin.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The question worth answering first is *\"when does it help?\"*, because it doesn't often help on a fully converged set of forward\n"
"bounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang tanong na dapat unang sagutin ay *\"kailan ito nakakatulong?\"*, dahil madalas itong hindi nakakatulong sa isang ganap nang converged na set ng forward\n"
"bound.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "Pag-setup {#setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the same Trotterized Ising circuit as the [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart), with the observable\n"
"on a single qubit in the middle of the chain. The 1D geometry makes the effect easy to reason about: an influence has\n"
"to traverse the chain one bond per layer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang parehong Trotterized Ising circuit gaya ng [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart), na ang observable ay\n"
"sa iisang qubit sa gitna ng chain. Dahil sa 1D na geometry, madaling suriin ang epekto: kailangang tumawid ang isang impluwensya\n"
"sa chain ng isang bond kada layer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When it helps, and when it does not {#when-it-helps-and-when-it-does-not}"
msgstr "Kailan ito nakakatulong, at kailan hindi {#when-it-helps-and-when-it-does-not}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`tighten_with_speed_limit` takes the bounds you already have and returns a tightened copy; your\n"
"original bounds are never modified. How much it gains depends entirely on how loose the input was.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kinukuha ng `tighten_with_speed_limit` ang mga bound na mayroon ka na at nagbabalik ng pinahigpit na kopya; ang\n"
"orihinal mong mga bound ay hindi kailanman binabago. Kung gaano ito makakapagpabuti ay nakadepende nang buo sa kung gaano kaluwag ang input.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first line is the one to notice. On fully computed forward bounds, the speed limit changes\n"
"nothing. That is not a failure. It means the bounds were already at least as tight as the geometric\n"
"argument can prove, because the operator evolution has effectively discovered the light cone for\n"
"itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang unang linya ang dapat mapansin. Sa mga ganap na nakalkulang forward bound, walang binabago ang speed limit.\n"
"Hindi ito pagkabigo. Ibig sabihin nito, kasing-higpit na ng maipapatunay ng geometric na argumento\n"
"ang mga bound, dahil natuklasan na ng operator evolution ang light cone\n"
"mag-isa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gains appear where the bounds were *not* fully computed:\n"
msgstr "Lumilitaw ang mga pakinabang kung saan *hindi* ganap na nakalkula ang mga bound:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`eigval_max_qubits=0` forces the triangle-inequality fallback, so the bounds no longer reflect the\n"
"commutator's actual spectral norm. The speed limit recovers part of that loss.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinipilit ng `eigval_max_qubits=0` ang triangle-inequality fallback, kaya hindi na sinasalamin ng mga bound ang aktwal na spectral norm ng\n"
"commutator. Nababawi ng speed limit ang bahagi ng nawalang iyon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`max_num_boxes=2` leaves most layers at the trivial bound of 2.0 (a bound that encodes no\n"
"information). Here, the speed limit is helpful, cutting the mean by roughly\n"
"a factor of three.\n"
msgstr ""
"Iniiwan ng `max_num_boxes=2` ang karamihan ng layer sa trivial na bound na 2.0 (isang bound na walang\n"
"sinasabing impormasyon). Dito, nakakatulong ang speed limit, na binabawasan ang mean nang humigit-kumulang\n"
"tatlong beses.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In every case the \"loosened\" column is zero. No term is ever made worse, which is the guarantee that\n"
"makes the step safe to apply unconditionally.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa bawat kaso, zero ang column na \"loosened\". Walang term na kailanman pinalala, na siyang garantiya\n"
"kung bakit ligtas ilapat ang hakbang na ito nang walang kondisyon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What it buys in sampling overhead {#what-it-buys-in-sampling-overhead}"
msgstr "Ano ang nabibili nito sa sampling overhead {#what-it-buys-in-sampling-overhead}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tighter bounds mean there are fewer error terms that need mitigating for a given bias tolerance, which is the\n"
"number that matters on hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mas mahigpit na mga bound ay nangangahulugan ng mas kaunting error term na kailangang i-mitigate para sa isang bias tolerance, na siyang\n"
"numerong mahalaga sa hardware.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When to use it {#when-to-use-it}"
msgstr "Kailan ito gagamitin {#when-to-use-it}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apply it to forward bounds whenever those bounds are not fully converged (essentially,\n"
"whenever you have traded accuracy for speed by using any of the options in the\n"
"[configuration guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/configuration-options)). It is cheap compared to the bounds computation,\n"
"cannot make anything worse, and recovers much of what a `max_num_boxes` or `eigval_max_qubits` limit\n"
"gave away.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ilapat ito sa mga forward bound tuwing hindi pa ganap na converged ang mga bound na iyon (sa madaling salita,\n"
"tuwing ipinagpalit mo ang katumpakan para sa bilis sa paggamit ng alinmang option sa\n"
"[configuration guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/configuration-options)). Mura ito kumpara sa pagkalkula ng mga bound,\n"
"hindi nito napalalala ang anuman, at nababawi nito ang karamihan sa isinuko ng limitasyong `max_num_boxes` o `eigval_max_qubits`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On fully computed bounds it is a no-op, so there is no harm in applying it unconditionally.\n"
msgstr "Sa mga ganap na nakalkulang bound, wala itong ginagawa, kaya walang masama sa paglalapat nito nang walang kondisyon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two limitations:\n"
msgstr "Dalawang limitasyon:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It applies to **forward** bounds only. Backward bounds concern the error's effect on the initial\n"
"state rather than on the observable, so the argument does not carry over.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para lang ito sa mga **forward** bound. Ang mga backward bound ay tungkol sa epekto ng error sa initial\n"
"state at hindi sa observable, kaya hindi umaangkop ang argumento.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The observable must be a **single Pauli term**. For an observable with several terms, call this\n"
"once per Pauli and combine the results yourself. If the observable is not a single Pauli term, it raises a `NotImplementedError`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang observable ay dapat na **iisang Pauli term**. Para sa observable na maraming term, tawagin ito\n"
"isang beses kada Pauli at pagsamahin mo mismo ang mga resulta. Kung hindi iisang Pauli term ang observable, magtataas ito ng `NotImplementedError`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the standard workflow, it belongs between computing the forward bounds and merging them with the\n"
"backward bounds, as the [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart) shows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa karaniwang workflow, nasa pagitan ito ng pagkalkula ng mga forward bound at pagsasama ng mga iyon sa\n"
"mga backward bound, gaya ng ipinapakita ng [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart).\n"
